sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Src as Weight store
    participant Tr as Tracker
    participant N1 as Node A
    participant N2 as Node B
    participant N3 as Node C
    Src->>Tr: publish the manifest — chunks and hashes
    N1->>Tr: who has what?
    Tr-->>N1: peer list
    N1->>Src: fetch a few chunks
    par swarm distribution
        N1->>N2: serve the chunks it has
        N2->>N3: forward on
        N3->>N1: send back what N1 is missing
    end
    Note over N1,N3: rarest-first, so no chunk becomes the bottleneck everyone waits on
    N1->>N1: verify each chunk hash before use
    Note over Src: the origin serves each chunk a handful of times, not once per node
